#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:735
msgid ""
"Let wwand step the system clock from the GNSS time — only while the clock is "
"plainly unset, so it never fights the NTP client. Off by default. For "
"installs with no RTC where the modem is the only time source."
msgstr ""
